# ── Impeccable ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tracked on purpose: DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md, .impeccable/design.json and
# .impeccable/surfaces/ (the design record). Everything below is working
# state, previews or per-machine config, which stays local.
.impeccable.md
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/mocks/
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/critique/*
!.impeccable/critique/ignore.md
.impeccable/history/
.impeccable/live/
.impeccable/provider-smoke/
.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
.impeccable-live.json
.impeccable-live/

